        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Malay Mental Health Notes</title>\n  <script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n  <script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    html, body {\n      margin: 0;\n      min-height: 100%;\n      background: #64695a;\n    }\n    body {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: center;\n      font-family: \"Times New Roman\", Georgia, serif;\n    }\n    .canvas {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 540px;\n      height: 720px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      background: #656a5b;\n    }\n    .page-no {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 3px;\n      left: 4px;\n      width: 28px;\n      height: 28px;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      background: #858978;\n      color: #c7c8b8;\n      text-align: center;\n      font: bold 15px Georgia, serif;\n      line-height: 28px;\n      box-shadow: inset 0 0 2px rgba(0,0,0,.18);\n    }\n    .top-strip {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 34px;\n      top: 17px;\n      width: 474px;\n      height: 50px;\n      background: #a8aa99;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(75,78,68,.26);\n    }\n    .tabs {\n      position: absolute;\n      z-index: 1;\n      top: 82px;\n      right: -1px;\n      width: 35px;\n      height: 621px;\n      color: #dddcca;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-family: Georgia, serif;\n    }\n    .tab {\n      width: 35px;\n      height: 62px;\n      border-radius: 0 12px 12px 0;\n      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      font-size: 18px;\n      text-shadow: 0 1px 1px rgba(0,0,0,.35);\n    }\n    .tab.menu {\n      height: 125px;\n      background: #dad6cb;\n      color: #8d8e83;\n      border-radius: 0 13px 13px 0;\n      font: 10px Arial, sans-serif;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n      writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n      padding-top: 10px;\n      justify-content: flex-start;\n    }\n    .t1 { height: 0; position: absolute; top: 87px; left: 0; color: #d9ded0; }\n    .t2 { background: #76847f; }\n    .t3 { background: #a76e70; }\n    .t4 { background: #705d51; }\n    .t5 { background: #c5c2ad; color: #eeeede; }\n    .t6 { background: #71837d; }\n    .t7 { background: #787c70; }\n    .t8 { background: #a9706e; }\n    .t9 { background: #6f7467; }\n    .tabs .tab:nth-of-type(2) { margin-top: 125px; }\n    .sheet {\n      position: absolute;\n      z-index: 2;\n      left: 34px;\n      top: 82px;\n      width: 474px;\n      height: 621px;\n      background: #a8aa99;\n      border-radius: 0 0 0 1px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n    .content {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 338px 1fr;\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 100%;\n    }\n    .main-text {\n      padding: 13px 14px 0 4px;\n      font-size: 16px;\n      line-height: 18.45px;\n      color: #171914;\n      font-weight: 400;\n    }\n    .main-text p {\n      margin: 0 0 7px 0;\n    }\n    .main-text p.gap {\n      margin-bottom: 9px;\n    }\n    .notes {\n      border-left: 2px solid #dddd8f;\n      margin-top: 3px;\n      padding: 20px 3px 0 9px;\n      color: #9e195a;\n      font-family: \"Comic Sans MS\", \"Bradley Hand\", cursive;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      font-style: italic;\n      line-height: 20px;\n      transform: rotate(-1deg);\n    }\n    .note {\n      margin: 0 0 20px 0;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .note.n2 { margin-bottom: 23px; }\n    .note.n3 { margin-bottom: 22px; }\n    .note.n4 { margin-bottom: 24px; }\n    .note.n5 { margin-bottom: 21px; }\n    .note.n6 { margin-bottom: 22px; }\n    .watermark {\n      position: absolute;\n      z-index: 4;\n      left: 218px;\n      bottom: 8px;\n      color: white;\n      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n      font-weight: 900;\n      font-size: 23px;\n      line-height: 22px;\n      text-shadow: 1px 1px 1px rgba(0,0,0,.24);\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .watermark small {\n      display: block;\n      font-size: 8px;\n      text-align: center;\n      margin-top: 5px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"canvas\">\n    <div class=\"page-no\">1</div>\n    <div class=\"top-strip\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"tabs\">\n      <div class=\"tab menu\">MENU</div>\n      <div class=\"tab t1\">1</div>\n      <div class=\"tab t2\">2</div>\n      <div class=\"tab t3\">3</div>\n      <div class=\"tab t4\">4</div>\n      <div class=\"tab t5\">5</div>\n      <div class=\"tab t6\">6</div>\n      <div class=\"tab t7\">7</div>\n      <div class=\"tab t8\">8</div>\n      <div class=\"tab t9\">9</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <main class=\"sheet\">\n      <div class=\"content\">\n        <section class=\"main-text\">\n          <p>Ketiga, di sesetengah universiti sokongan dan<br>bantuan berkaitan kesihatan mental masih lagi<br>berkurangan.</p>\n\n          <p class=\"gap\">Hal ini menyebabkan ramai pelajar tidak<br>mempunyai capaian kepada bantuan kesihatan<br>mental yang diperlukan dan ini sering<br>menyebabkan masalah mereka menjadi semakin<br>teruk.</p>\n\n          <p class=\"gap\">Bagaimanapun di sebalik semua cabaran itu,<br>kesedaran mengenai kesihatan mental perlu<br>dibuat secara berterusan. Masih terdapat banyak<br>langkah yang boleh diambil untuk tujuan itu.</p>\n\n          <p class=\"gap\">Antaranya, IPT sendiri perlu program berkaitan<br>isu itu seperti bengkel kemahiran menguruskan<br>tekanan, ceramah dan klinik kesihatan mental.</p>\n\n          <p class=\"gap\">Selain itu, pihak IPT perlu menyediakan<br>sokongan yang mencukupi kepada pelajar,<br>termasuk sokongan kewangan dan sumber<br>bantuan kesihatan mental.</p>\n\n          <p class=\"gap\">Keduanya, pelajar universiti perlu didedahkan<br>dengan pengetahuan mengenai kesihatan mental<br>dan cara untuk menguruskan kesihatan mental<br>mereka sendiri.</p>\n\n          <p>Selain itu, adalah penting untuk mengurangkan<br>stigma dan diskriminasi terhadap pelajar<br>kesihatan mental dalam kalangan pelajar<br>universiti di Malaysia.</p>\n        </section>\n\n        <aside class=\"notes\">\n          <div class=\"note\">sesetengah 一部分<br>berkaitan 关于<br>berkurangan 减少</div>\n          <div class=\"note n2\">menyebabkan 导致<br>capaian 取得的东西<br>semakin 越来越</div>\n          <div class=\"note n3\">sebalik 反面<br>berterusan 持续<br>tujuan 目的</div>\n          <div class=\"note n4\">program 项目<br>bengkel 研讨会<br>ceramah 演讲</div>\n          <div class=\"note n5\">menyediakan 准备<br>mencukupi 足够<br>sumber 来源</div>\n          <div class=\"note n6\">didedahkan 被影响</div>\n          <div class=\"note\">diskriminasi 歧视<br>kalangan 圈子</div>\n        </aside>\n      </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <div class=\"watermark\">（爱读书的芳）<small>Zoom HPTA</small></div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
